# WeChat for Loon
# Generated: 2026-08-22
# Purpose: WeChat/微信 DIRECT remote rule for Loon
# Sources:
# - User's legacy NobyDa Surge WeChat.list (uploaded)
# - blackmatrix7 Loon WeChat rule, updated 2025-06-06
# - User's existing local WeChat DIRECT rules
#
# Design:
# - Domain-first: keep current/core WeChat domains.
# - Do NOT copy the legacy 233 IP-like DOMAIN-KEYWORD entries or IPv6 blocks.
# - Do NOT include broad IP-ASN, to avoid routing unrelated Tencent Cloud traffic.
# - Policy is assigned by Loon [Remote Rule], so rules here contain no policy.

# ----- Exact core / login / telemetry -----
DOMAIN,apd-pcdnwxlogin.teg.tencent-cloud.net
DOMAIN,btrace.qq.com
DOMAIN,dldir1.qq.com
DOMAIN,slife.xy-asia.com
DOMAIN,soup.v.qq.com
DOMAIN,vweixinf.tc.qq.com
DOMAIN,weixin110.qq.com
DOMAIN,wup.imtt.qq.com

# ----- DNS / dispatch -----
DOMAIN,dns.weixin.qq.com
DOMAIN,dns.weixin.qq.com.cn

# ----- WeChat / Weixin core -----
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wechat.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wechatlegal.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wechatos.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wechatpay.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,weixin.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,weixin.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,weixinbridge.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,weixinsxy.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,servicewechat.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wx.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wxs.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wxapp.tc.qq.com

# ----- Payment -----
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tenpay.com

# ----- Media / avatars / static -----
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,qlogo.cn
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,qpic.cn
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wx.gtimg.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wximg.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wxvideo.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,vweixinthumb.tc.qq.com

# ----- Map / location / Tencent IoT -----
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,map.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,lbs.gtimg.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,iot-tencent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,up-hl.3g.qq.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,yun-hl.3g.qq.com

# ----- HTTP(S) User-Agent fallback -----
USER-AGENT,MicroMessenger*
USER-AGENT,WeChat*

# ----- WeChat UDP / direct IP fallback -----
IP-CIDR,111.30.160.0/20,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,112.53.11.0/24,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,112.53.20.0/24,no-resolve
